  "CharacterDescription": "Harren Botley is the eldest son of Lord Sawane Botley of Lordsport on Pyke - heir to one of the lesser Iron Islands lordships. The Botleys operate the port that serves as the main entry point for Pyke island, subordinate to House Greyjoy in every meaningful way. Harren is young, earnest in the Iron Islands way - which means practical rather than sentimental, direct rather than polite. He has a younger brother Tristifer who has unusual interests for an Ironborn and Harren has made peace with being the more conventional of the two.",
